      "updated": 1775852190778,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Prompt to the Development/Roadmap page\nwith the starting phase of Roadmap\nThis page will have the Segmented level \nor section divide properly with each of it having\nMaterial, Instructions and task or test to set \nCompletion of section\nFor the final Part an Full on test or task to \nComplete Skill roadmap and its Reward/Milestone with increase\nin rank and an Certificate ",
      "fontSize": 36,
      "fontFamily": 8,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Prompt to the Development/Roadmap page\nwith the starting phase of Roadmap\nThis page will have the Segmented level \nor section divide properly with each of it having\nMaterial, Instructions and task or test to set \nCompletion of section\nFor the final Part an Full on test or task to \nComplete Skill roadmap and its Reward/Milestone with increase\nin rank and an Certificate ",
